1
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,840
Zhao Nanfeng.

2
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,160
Let's

3
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,560
talk inside.

4
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,160
Look at this.

5
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,080
Do you know what your sister did

6
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:06,680
before?

7
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,570
I don't know.

8
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:12,120
She sent me money a few times,

9
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,360
but I didn't ask for details.

10
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:18,200
You don't know about Zixuan either,
do you?

11
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:18,800
Zixuan?

12
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,400
What happened to Zixuan?

13
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,000
Here,

14
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:22,980
take a look.

15
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,120
He's not my biological son.

16
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,039
Did you know that?

17
00:01:27,039 --> 00:01:28,520
I raised him for ten years,

18
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:30,980
and he's not my biological son.
Did you know?

19
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,640
I really didn't know.

20
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,880
Who gave you this?

21
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,200
Who gave it to you?

22
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,200
Speak!

23
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:49,720
Zhao Beifeng.

24
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:58,800
Brother-in-law.

25
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:02,530
I received a USB drive this morning

26
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,920
and a call from an unknown number,

27
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,360
telling me to withdraw the appeal

28
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,690
and stop investigating my sister's case,

29
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:09,729
or they'll expose all this.

30
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:15,170
I just gave him two million,

31
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:18,120
and he's already going back on his word.

32
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,200
I have to call the police

33
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:26,000
and hand over all this evidence.

34
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,700
Don't call the police yet.

35
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,800
There's another woman here.

36
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,620
I've already found out who this woman is.

37
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,200
She must know about your sister's past,

38
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:46,120
maybe even how she died.

39
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,410
Here's the plan.

40
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,560
It's not convenient for me

41
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,690
to show up right now.

42
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,800
You go meet her

43
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:55,240
and find out

44
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,640
what exactly happened.

45
00:02:58,440 --> 00:02:58,840
Okay.

46
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,300
Does this apply to Zhou Yawen's case?

47
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:03,820
It does.

48
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:05,920
Both phones are registered
with real names.

49
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,640
We can directly run a signal overlap test.

50
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:08,920
We'll use base station signals

51
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,040
to confirm
if the two phones' signals overlapped

52
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:12,280
on the night of the crime.

53
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,720
The accuracy is

54
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,780
within two meters.

55
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:16,720
In that case,

56
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,000
as long as we confirm Zhao Nanfeng was

57
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,160
the last person Zhou Yawen saw
before she died,

58
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:22,040
if their phone signals overlapped

59
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,680
and Zhao Nanfeng was at the dumping site,

60
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,680
it must be her.

61
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:28,000
When can we expect the results?

62
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,560
I know you're in a hurry.

63
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,560
We'll be as quick as we can.

64
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:33,360
What about that mysterious number
ending in 6129?

65
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,079
It's not registered with a real name.

66
00:03:35,079 --> 00:03:36,079
We need to confirm

67
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,560
the owner's identity first.

68
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,760
But we can check if it's active.

69
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:40,760
Also,

70
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,560
the hard drive was soaked in a beverage.

71
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,920
I'm not sure how much we can recover.

72
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:44,560
It depends

73
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,020
on luck.

74
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,079
Whatever it takes,

75
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:48,120
let's just give it a try.

76
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,560
What if we find new clues?

77
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,480
We can only provide the data.

78
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:54,160
You'll have to piece together
the remaining logic and connections

79
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:54,960
yourselves.

80
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,200
Got it.

81
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,960
When Yishan brings Chengcheng over,

82
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:03,200
I'll definitely let them try my cooking.

83
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:03,720
Come on.

84
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:05,480
What kind of cooking skills do you have?

85
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,400
Don't look down on me.

86
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,000
I've been hiding my talents.

87
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,040
Just scare them. It's too dangerous.

88
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:24,440
Are you really going
to fight a prosecutor?

89
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,760
Wei,

90
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:16,880
Bro!

91
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:18,570
This won't work.

92
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:32,740
Freeze!

93
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,040
Kaixin,

94
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,970
don't chase him!

95
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:38,120
Watch out!

96
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:43,780
Kaixin,

97
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,850
call the police!

98
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,320
Okay.

99
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,400
You're in for a treat today.

100
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,400
Kaixin said

101
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:50,080
she's going to cook for you herself today.

102
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,040
Can she cook?

103
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,080
Why are you looking down on me?

104
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,640
Can I even swallow this?

105
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,040
Be careful next time.

106
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,650
Are you okay?

107
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:03,640
Let me see.

108
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,240
It's fine.

109
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,080
Prosecutor Qiao,

110
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,000
I'm so sorry

111
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,000
to trouble you

112
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,730
to come all the way here so late.

113
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:18,810
I'm really fine.

114
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:21,720
You're in the hospital
and you say you're fine?

115
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:24,720
Besides, Fang Wei
and Chang Kaixin were also threatened.

116
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,920
They'll be here soon.

117
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,240
Xu Yishan, are you okay?

118
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,440
Yishan, are you okay?

119
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:31,480
Hello, Prosecutor Qiao.

120
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,480
Prosecutor Qiao.

121
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,440
You guys talk.

122
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,700
I'll go buy something.

123
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:38,720
Cheng.

124
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:39,600
Come

125
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,260
out with me.

126
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,340
Where are you hurt?

127
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:43,159
I'm fine.

128
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:44,120
Just a scratch.

129
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,520
Are you sure you're not hurt?

130
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,650
What did the doctor say?

131
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,680
Don't worry, you two.

132
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,040
Sit

133
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:55,860
down first.

134
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,000
Prosecutor Qiao just said

135
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,320
you were threatened too.

136
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,650
What exactly happened?

137
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,920
Something was thrown at us from above.

138
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:05,280
The flower pot exploded right at our feet.

139
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:06,920
Missed us by five centimeters.

140
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,980
I went up to the roof

141
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,520
and saw some fresh cigarette butts.

142
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,920
They must have left them.

143
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,840
I've already handed them over
to the police.

144
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:15,040
Wei was so brave just now.

145
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:17,320
She subdued the thug on the spot.

146
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:19,000
That guy has already been taken away
by the police.

147
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,400
But another one got away.

148
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,800
Why were you so impulsive?

149
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,520
How could you go out by yourself?

150
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,680
I'm fine, aren't I?

151
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,360
Look at you.

152
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:26,440
I can testify.

153
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,220
Wei really isn't hurt.

154
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,600
Threatening and attacking prosecutors,

155
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,440
challenging judicial authority.

156
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:34,300
These people are simply lawless.

157
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,040
No matter who the mastermind is,

158
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,840
they must be severely punished.

159
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,320
I'll get going.

160
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:42,720
You guys take care of her.

161
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,400
Take care, Prosecutor Qiao.

162
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,720
Let me see where you're hurt.

163
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:49,400
Yishan, you have no idea.

164
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,320
Wei was really amazing just now.

165
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:52,300
We were just

166
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:53,520
following the thug,

167
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:54,240
quietly...

168
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,240
Walking quietly.

169
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:58,520
The thug was about to attack us
with a stick,

170
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,360
but Wei just countered...

171
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:00,960
Like this.

172
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,680
Then Wei turned around

173
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,600
to check on me,

174
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,160
and as if she had eyes
on the back of her head,

175
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,440
she kicked back.

176
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,640
Alright, alright.

177
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:12,240
It wasn't that exaggerated.

178
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,960
Just a few punks.

179
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,160
Don't worry about me.

180
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,100
What about you?

181
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,760
Why are you in the hospital?

182
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:19,160
Where exactly are you hurt?

183
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,560
It's just a mild concussion,

184
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:23,000
so I need to stay
overnight for observation.

185
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,000
A mild concussion?

186
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:24,760
I don't buy it.

187
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,640
Where's your medical record?

188
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,440
Show it to me.

189
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,560
Let's get our stories straight first.

190
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,440
What time were you attacked?

191
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,200
Were they the same group that attacked me?

192
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:32,200
Don't interrupt.

193
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,520
We'll talk about this
back at the institute.

194
00:08:33,520 --> 00:08:34,720
Confess everything.

195
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:43,640
Hello?

196
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,240
I sent you the address.

197
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,240
See you tomorrow.

198
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,260
Who are you?

199
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,320
What exactly do you want?

200
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,600
I have the secret you want.

201
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,060
You'll know when you come.

202
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:54,960
Before you come,

203
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,760
remember to handle that matter.

204
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:12,880
Yishan,

205
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:15,560
the guy who peeled that apple for you

206
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,890
is your husband, right?

207
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,120
You two are such a perfect match!

208
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,760
Don't say a word.

209
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,760
Let me guess.

210
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,120
Wearing a suit

211
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,600
late at night.

212
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,160
A boss?

213
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:28,280
No,

214
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,800
Yishan doesn't like bosses.

215
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:30,600
Then it must be

216
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:31,640
a lawyer.

217
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:33,440
Wei,

218
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,640
what are you doing?

219
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:36,570
Why are you ruining my gossip time?

220
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,360
A lawyer.

221
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,120
A lawyer and a prosecutor.

222
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,800
A power couple,

223
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:45,240
evenly matched.

224
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,560
So perfect and happy.

225
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:51,320
I want that too.

226
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,040
Come on, tell me.

227
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:52,400
Alright,

228
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:53,040
that's enough.

229
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,240
-How did you guys meet?

230
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,960
-Don't disturb the patient.

231
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:56,520
I know.

232
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,040
Alright,

233
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:58,170
I'll see myself out.

234
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:58,680
Go on.

235
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,320
Kaixin is quite cute.

236
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,250
She's so loud...

237
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:06,020
...it gives me a headache.

238
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,160
Where is the medical record?

239
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,040
You're not gonna tell me, huh?

240
00:10:12,040 --> 00:10:13,160
I'll find it myself.

241
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:13,720
Wait.

242
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:21,420
Leucogen tablets.

243
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,170
Whose are these?

244
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,120
Whose?

245
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,320
Probably Jiang Yuan's.

246
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,000
I must have put the next bed's stuff here

247
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,680
when packing up just now.

248
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,770
I'll return them later.

249
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,480
Does a 19-year-old girl

250
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,940
need Leucogen tablets for an appendectomy?

251
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,160
Zhou Yajun dropped the lawsuit.

252
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,180
I'll question you when I get back.

253
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,360
You're just making things worse for me.

254
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:56,360
They were already suspicious of me.

255
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,680
Now it's even harder to explain.

256
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,720
I was just trying to help you vent.

257
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:03,240
Relax,

258
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:03,920
they won't

259
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,400
trace it to me.

260
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,080
They're my people.

261
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,540
I'm confident about that.

262
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,280
Confident?

263
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:11,260
Where does that come from?

264
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,960
Just remember this...

265
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,480
In this world, besides me, your sister,

266
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,740
there's no one you can absolutely trust.

267
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:20,760
Run.

268
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:31,680
Zhou Yajun, are you home?

269
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,440
He hung up on me.

270
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,380
Call again.

271
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:55,500
Sorry, the number
you dialed is powered off.

272
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:57,960
His phone is off.

273
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,250
Let's go back first.

274
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:17,690
Who is it?

275
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,640
Why haven't you left yet?

276
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:25,410
Don't worry.

277
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,280
Cheng went home to sleep.

278
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,250
Are you planning to stay the night?

279
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:37,480
I'm

280
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,080
worried

281
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,880
about you being like this.

282
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:40,440
I'm fine.

283
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:42,040
Thanks for your concern.

284
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,780
You can really go back now.

285
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:59,850
Your husband isn't staying the night?

286
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,370
He's my ex-husband.

287
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:03,410
Did he cheat?

288
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:05,040
Why?

289
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,620
Is it because you got sick?

290
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:09,970
We parted amicably.

291
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:13,290
Why would you split up
if everything was fine?

292
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,220
There's no right or wrong in many things.

293
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,960
We just weren't a good match.

294
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,640
The one who threw the flower pot at you...

295
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:27,960
It's that kid Zhao Yong.

296
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:30,120
He said he was instructed by Zhao Beifeng

297
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,520
and even threatened Zhou Yajun.

298
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:32,240
Captain Zheng,

299
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,200
is it possible

300
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:35,530
that this is also related to Zhao Nanfeng?

301
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:37,520
Please look into it further.

302
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:38,840
Zhao Beifeng is on the run.

303
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,570
Don't worry.

304
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,320
We'll speed up the investigation.

305
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,520
I'll keep you updated

306
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,650
if there's any news.

307
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,370
Let's keep in touch.

308
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,690
Morning, Prosecutor Fang.

309
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:51,640
How is Prosecutor Xu doing?

310
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,440
She's hospitalized,

311
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:53,900
but it's nothing serious.

312
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,720
She's in the hospital
and it's nothing serious?

313
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,800
Come on, guys.

314
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,920
As the only guy in the office,

315
00:13:58,920 --> 00:13:59,880
you should've told me.

316
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,000
What good would telling you do?

317
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:01,760
Alright.

318
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,760
While Yishan is in the hospital,

319
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:06,400
let's step up with our work

320
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,200
and keep a close eye on things

321
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,330
so she can rest well.

322
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:10,530
Back to work.

323
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:17,160
Good morning.

324
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,720
Yishan!

325
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,880
Why are you back?

326
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:23,920
Are you...

327
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,400
Did the doctor discharge you?

328
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,060
Have a seat.

329
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,880
You sneaked out, didn't you?

330
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:29,800
When will you ever fix this bad habit?

331
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:31,160
Can you give it a rest?

332
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:32,800
Even the doctor doesn't nag this much.

333
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:33,680
I told you yesterday,

334
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:35,560
I only needed to stay
overnight for observation.

335
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:36,290
I'm fine now.

336
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,360
You finally got some rest.

337
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,600
Stay in the hospital
for a couple more days

338
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,600
for observation.

339
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,680
Exactly.

340
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:43,880
Taking a couple of days off

341
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,800
won't delay anything.

342
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:46,920
I'm really fine.

343
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,680
Aren't I sitting right here
in front of you?

344
00:14:49,760 --> 00:14:50,400
Come on,

345
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:51,160
tell me.

346
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,560
After Zhou Yajun dropped the lawsuit,

347
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:54,490
Will it have any impact on our case?

348
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,000
Good news.

349
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,780
The appraisal center said

350
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:02,460
the hard drive recovery report
will be out soon.

351
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:03,480
And...

352
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,600
we checked the bank statements
of Zhao Nanfeng

353
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:06,280
and Zhou Yawen's mother.

354
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,960
From July 2010

355
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:09,200
to June 2012,

356
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,680
Zhao Nanfeng continuously

357
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,080
transferred money to Zhou Yawen's mother.

358
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:12,800
The single amount

359
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,400
ranged from 800 to 3,000 yuan,

360
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:15,400
transferred irregularly.

361
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:16,520
But the monthly amount

362
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:18,440
was generally around 32,000 yuan.

363
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,680
Over 30,000 a month?

364
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:23,520
Zhou Yawen had just come
of age then, right?

365
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:25,400
Was this card in her hands?

366
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:26,400
We suspect

367
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:29,460
all this money was actually transferred
to Zhou Yawen.

368
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:32,080
We're going to contact the police

369
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:34,610
to see if we can track
Zhou Yajun's movements.

370
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,040
Perfect.

371
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:37,340
Let's go right now.

372
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,120
Don't worry, Yishan.

373
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:39,850
Back to work.

374
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:40,920
Let's go.

375
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,360
We're leaving.

376
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,220
Close the door.

377
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,640
These two are really energetic.

378
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,360
Why are you looking at me?

379
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:05,100
I know what you want to ask,

380
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,130
but don't ask anything.

381
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:09,000
A breakthrough in the case

382
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,560
is what I look forward to the most.

383
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:11,220
You know me.

384
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:13,600
I'll tell you

385
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:14,840
when I can.

386
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:17,410
Let's get to work first.

387
00:16:19,800 --> 00:16:20,130
Okay.

388
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:35,120
Handsome, what kind of
haircut do you want?

389
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:35,880
Liu Qian.

390
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:37,920
You know me?

391
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:40,180
I'm Zhou Yawen's brother,

392
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:41,480
Zhou Yajun.

393
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:48,520
What's the result?

394
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,560
One piece of good news

395
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:50,560
and one piece of bad news.

396
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:52,090
Tell us the good news first.

397
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,120
Although this number

398
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,120
only called Zhou Yawen

399
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,440
on the day of the incident,

400
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:59,040
it received nearly
a hundred text messages.

401
00:16:59,040 --> 00:16:59,880
Including these

402
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:01,610
sent by local tourism bureaus.

403
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:06,560
But I often receive
this kind of text message too.

404
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:08,000
Aren't you suspecting Zhao Nanfeng?

405
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,200
We plan to filter out all such messages

406
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,720
and have the police verify

407
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:13,240
if Zhao Nanfeng appeared in these places

408
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,369
during these times.

409
00:17:14,839 --> 00:17:17,200
At the same time, retrieving the surveillance
footage of the corresponding time periods

410
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,960
will basically confirm if it's her.

411
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:19,960
Is this reliable?

412
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:20,599
After verification,

413
00:17:20,599 --> 00:17:21,599
we will also conduct a parallel analysis

414
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:22,839
of this number

415
00:17:22,839 --> 00:17:24,170
and Zhou Yawen's number

416
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,260
to further confirm

417
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,170
Zhao Nanfeng's suspicion.

418
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:28,730
What's the bad news?

419
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:29,960
The hard drive can't be repaired.
